## Article 173. Preparatory proceedings

```catala
declaration scope Article173PreparatoryProceedings:
  input preparatory content PreparatoryProceeding
  output preparatoryDeadlineDays content integer
  output preparatoryRequired content YesNo

scope Article173PreparatoryProceedings:
  label deadline definition preparatoryDeadlineDays equals 60

  label required_simplified definition preparatoryRequired under condition
    preparatory.stage = PreparatoryStage.SkippedSimplified
    consequence equals No

  label required_general definition preparatoryRequired under condition
    preparatory.stage != PreparatoryStage.SkippedSimplified
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 174. Sending copies of ruling opening proceedings

```catala
declaration scope Article174SendingRuling:
  input proceedingsOpened content YesNo
  input copiesSentToAllParties content YesNo
  input sentWithinThreeDays content YesNo
  output notificationComplete content YesNo

scope Article174SendingRuling:
  label notification_default definition notificationComplete equals No

  label notification_done exception notification_default
  definition notificationComplete under condition
    proceedingsOpened = Yes
    and copiesSentToAllParties = Yes
    and sentWithinThreeDays = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 175. Defense statement (відзив)

```catala
declaration scope Article175DefenseStatement:
  input defenseFiled content YesNo
  input filedWithinFifteenDays content YesNo
  input respondsToEachClaim content YesNo
  input statesDefendantPosition content YesNo
  input listsDefenseEvidence content YesNo
  output defenseMeetsRequirements content YesNo

scope Article175DefenseStatement:
  label defense_default definition defenseMeetsRequirements equals No

  label defense_complete exception defense_default
  definition defenseMeetsRequirements under condition
    defenseFiled = Yes
    and filedWithinFifteenDays = Yes
    and respondsToEachClaim = Yes
    and statesDefendantPosition = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 176. Third party explanations

```catala
declaration scope Article176ThirdPartyExplanations:
  input explanationFiled content YesNo
  input filedWithinFifteenDays content YesNo
  input thirdPartyIdentified content YesNo
  input explainsPosition content YesNo
  output explanationAccepted content YesNo

scope Article176ThirdPartyExplanations:
  label explanation_default definition explanationAccepted equals No

  label explanation_accepted exception explanation_default
  definition explanationAccepted under condition
    explanationFiled = Yes
    and filedWithinFifteenDays = Yes
    and thirdPartyIdentified = Yes
    and explainsPosition = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 177. Counterclaim

```catala
declaration scope Article177Counterclaim:
  input counterclaim content CounterclaimFiling
  input counterclaimFiledBeforeMerits content YesNo
  output counterclaimCanBeFiled content YesNo

scope Article177Counterclaim:
  label counterclaim_default definition counterclaimCanBeFiled equals No

  label counterclaim_available exception counterclaim_default
  definition counterclaimCanBeFiled under condition
    counterclaim.counterclaimRelatedToOriginal = Yes
    and counterclaimFiledBeforeMerits = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 178. Counterclaim form and content

```catala
declaration scope Article178CounterclaimForm:
  input counterclaim content CounterclaimFiling
  input specifiesCourt content YesNo
  input specifiesCounterclaimant content YesNo
  input specifiesCounterclaimSubject content YesNo
  input specifiesCounterclaimGrounds content YesNo
  input specifiesCounterclaimRelief content YesNo
  output counterclaimMeetsFormRequirements content YesNo

scope Article178CounterclaimForm:
  label form_default definition counterclaimMeetsFormRequirements equals No

  label form_complete exception form_default
  definition counterclaimMeetsFormRequirements under condition
    specifiesCourt = Yes
    and specifiesCounterclaimant = Yes
    and specifiesCounterclaimSubject = Yes
    and specifiesCounterclaimGrounds = Yes
    and specifiesCounterclaimRelief = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 179. Preparatory hearing

```catala
declaration scope Article179PreparatoryHearing:
  input preparatory content PreparatoryProceeding
  input hearingScheduledWithinThirtyDays content YesNo
  output preparatoryHearingCanBeHeld content YesNo

scope Article179PreparatoryHearing:
  label hearing_default definition preparatoryHearingCanBeHeld equals No

  label hearing_available exception hearing_default
  definition preparatoryHearingCanBeHeld under condition
    preparatory.stage = PreparatoryStage.InProgress
    and hearingScheduledWithinThirtyDays = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 180. Preparatory hearing tasks

```catala
declaration scope Article180PreparatoryTasks:
  input preparatory content PreparatoryProceeding
  input partiesClarifiedPositions content YesNo
  input evidenceIdentified content YesNo
  input reconciliationExplored content YesNo
  input jurisdictionConfirmed content YesNo
  input compositionCorrect content YesNo
  input recusalsResolved content YesNo
  output preparatoryTasksCompleted content YesNo

scope Article180PreparatoryTasks:
  label tasks_default definition preparatoryTasksCompleted equals No

  label tasks_complete exception tasks_default
  definition preparatoryTasksCompleted under condition
    partiesClarifiedPositions = Yes
    and evidenceIdentified = Yes
    and reconciliationExplored = Yes
    and jurisdictionConfirmed = Yes
    and compositionCorrect = Yes
    and recusalsResolved = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 181. Order of preparatory hearing

```catala
declaration scope Article181PreparatoryOrder:
  input hearing content HearingProceeding
  input presidingJudgeAssigned content YesNo
  output hearingOrderFollowed content YesNo

scope Article181PreparatoryOrder:
  label order_default definition hearingOrderFollowed equals No

  label order_correct exception order_default
  definition hearingOrderFollowed under condition
    presidingJudgeAssigned = Yes
    and hearing.allPartiesNotified = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 182. Response to defense and objections

```catala
declaration scope Article182ResponseToDefense:
  input responseFiled content YesNo
  input filedWithinDeadline content YesNo
  input respondsToEachDefensePoint content YesNo
  output responseAccepted content YesNo

scope Article182ResponseToDefense:
  label response_default definition responseAccepted equals No

  label response_accepted exception response_default
  definition responseAccepted under condition
    responseFiled = Yes
    and filedWithinDeadline = Yes
    and respondsToEachDefensePoint = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 183. Court decisions in preparatory hearing

```catala
declaration scope Article183PreparatoryDecisions:
  input preparatory content PreparatoryProceeding
  input preparatoryTasksCompleted content YesNo
  output canScheduleMeritsHearing content YesNo

scope Article183PreparatoryDecisions:
  label schedule_default definition canScheduleMeritsHearing equals No

  label schedule_ready exception schedule_default
  definition canScheduleMeritsHearing under condition
    preparatoryTasksCompleted = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```
